        "summary": "Since Nov 2025 Johan Hovold has posted a run of one-driver-at-a-time patches that only 'enable compile testing' for drivers nothing prevented from being compiled. The patches went to at_hdmac, bcm2835 dmaengine, tegra iommu, omap-ocp2scp and k3-socinfo, and maintainers applied them. Whole drivers were outside every COMPILE_TEST/allyesconfig/randconfig build until someone noticed by hand. No tool reports which objects no standard config can build.",
